  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The name first appears on the alliance slope during the three-clan Gu battle tournament. Xiong Jiang of the Xiong clan challenges Bai Bing Yi, then reveals Shadow Bond Gu after taking a Water Drill Gu blow.",
        "chapters": [
          125
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_xiong_jiang",
          "fac_xiong_clan",
          "char_bai_bing_yi",
          "gu_water_drill_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The bond’s range is limited. Xiong Jiang says it can only bully close-ranged Gu Masters.",
        "chapters": [
          125
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "range-and-weakness",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later narration pins the effective range at ten meters.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "range-and-weakness",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "If the linked foe pulls enough distance, the shadow splits and the bond fails.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "range-and-weakness",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After Xiong Li dies, Xiong Jiang activates Shadow Bond Gu and joins his shadow to Bai Ning Bing’s, hoping shared damage will stop a killing blow while Xiong Lin flees. Bai Ning Bing treats the Gu as a cheap method and shows no fear of the link. Fang Yuan then kills Xiong Jiang with a moonblade while the bond is still up. Xiong Jiang’s death injury transmits through the shadow, and Bai Ning Bing suffers the shared damage, bleeding from ears, nose, and eyes.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_xiong_li",
          "char_xiong_lin",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
